{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block content %}
    <h1>Example Physio Clinic</h1>
    <p>We help adults and children recover movement, ease pain and return to the activities they enjoy. Every first appointment starts with a conversation about your symptoms, your daily life and your goals.</p>
    <h2>An assessment before any treatment</h2>
    <p>We assess your joints, muscles and movement, explain what we find in plain words and agree a treatment plan with you. The plan is reviewed at each visit.</p>
    <p>See the <a href="/treatments">treatments we offer</a> or <a href="/contact">contact the clinic</a> to book.</p>
